            "explanation": "YES/NO question → reported speech: ASKED + IF + subject + verb (normal order). 'Do YOU celebrate?' → asked IF THEY CELEBRATED. Pronoun: you → they. Tense: do celebrate → celebrated. Word order is normal after 'if'.",
