                "hint": "ONE BOOK A WEEK during the school term = a habit repeated again and again, and the subject is a single person. Ask: in the simple present, what does a singular subject add to the plain verb?",
                "explanation": "A regular habit = simple present. She (singular) → READS at least one book a week."
