                "hint": "Count them: OF HER TWO PREPARED ENDINGS - the choice comes from a fixed, limited set. Ask: does the open question word belong here, or the choosing one? Use the choosing word whenever the options are already listed.",
                "explanation": "WHICH = used when choosing from a specific, limited set. 'Which of her two endings' = choosing from exactly two options. WHICH asks about specific choices."
