                "hint": "The dash explains it: A FALSE IMAGE THAT THE BRAIN ACCEPTS AS REAL. Note 'an' in front of the gap - the word must begin with a vowel sound. Ask: which box word names that false picture in the mind?",
                "explanation": "An ILLUSION = a false image or impression that the mind accepts as real. Magic tricks create ILLUSIONS by exploiting how the brain processes visual information."
