            "passage": "Every fire engine (1)________ thoroughly after each call-out to ensure it is always ready for the next emergency. All firefighters (2)________ for at least two years before they are allowed to attend a real fire. This fire station (3)________ in 1987 and has served the community ever since. Three people (4)________ from the burning flat by the crew last Tuesday evening. The fire safety manual (5)________ three times since it was first published, to include new guidelines for high-rise buildings. New smoke detectors (6)________ in every flat in the estate since last year as part of a government safety programme. One of the hoses (7)________ right now after it was damaged during last week's call-out. The new ladder truck (8)________ when the alarm sounded for a real fire.",
