                "hint": "The blank names the FIREFIGHTERS themselves - the people who do the job. Ask: which box word is a noun meaning the staff of an organisation? 'Apparatus' names their equipment, not the men and women who carry it.",
                "explanation": "PERSONNEL = the people who work in an organisation. SCDF PERSONNEL = the firefighters and staff who work for SCDF."
