            "sentence": "The cockerel crows every morning without fail, ________ it?",
            "options": [
              "does",
              "doesn't",
              "is",
              "isn't"
            ],
            "answer": 1,
            "explanation": "Positive simple present (third person singular) → negative tag. The cockerel CROWS every morning, DOESN'T it? DOES → DOESN'T. Positive → negative tag.",
