                "hint": "DURIAN SEASON arrives with a whole month: JUNE. Ask: which box preposition goes with months, years and seasons? The word for days of the week and the word for exact clock times will not do here.",
                "explanation": "IN + month, year or season. Durian season is IN JUNE = in that month. IN June, IN 2024, IN summer = always use IN for months, years and seasons."
